<head xml:id="pVII-b1" facs="#f0011-b1"><lb n="1" facs="#f0011-l1"/>Inhalts-Uebersicht.</head>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="pVII-b2" facs="#f0011-b2"><lb n="2" facs="#f0011-l2"/>I. Theil: Allgemeine Landes- und Volkskunde des <placeName ref="#place-fuerstenthum-reuss-juengerer-linie">Fürstenthums <lb n="3" facs="#f0011-l3"/>Reuß j. L.</placeName></ab>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="pVII-b3" facs="#f0011-b3"><lb n="4" facs="#f0011-l4"/>I. Die Natur des Landes.</ab>
<table xml:id="pVII-b4" facs="#f0011-b4" rows="10" cols="2"><row role="label"><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label">Seite.</cell></row><row><cell>1) Ueberblick und Bild des Ganzen</cell><cell>3—5.</cell></row><row><cell>2) Mathematische Lage</cell><cell>6—7.</cell></row><row><cell>3) Größe oder Umfang der Bodenfläche</cell><cell>7—8.</cell></row><row><cell>4) Plastik</cell><cell>9—24.</cell></row><row><cell>5) Geognostische Uebersicht</cell><cell>24—41.</cell></row><row><cell>6) Bewässerung</cell><cell>41—53.</cell></row><row><cell>7) Klima</cell><cell>53—70.</cell></row><row><cell>8) Vegetationsverhältnisse</cell><cell>70—81.</cell></row><row><cell>9) Fauna</cell><cell>81—90.</cell></row></table>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="pVII-b5" facs="#f0011-b5"><lb n="11" facs="#f0011-l11"/>II. Das Volk.</ab>
<table xml:id="pVII-b6" facs="#f0011-b6" rows="8" cols="2"><row><cell>1) Statistik</cell><cell>91—118.</cell></row><row><cell>2) Wohnliche Einrichtung</cell><cell>119—138.</cell></row><row><cell>3) Mundart</cell><cell>138—154.</cell></row><row><cell>4) Kleid und Kost</cell><cell>154—161.</cell></row><row><cell>5) Gestalt und Character</cell><cell>161—168.</cell></row><row><cell>6) Volkskrankheit und Volksmedicin</cell><cell>168—177.</cell></row><row><cell>7) Sitte und Brauch</cell><cell>177—195.</cell></row><row><cell>8) Sage und Glaube</cell><cell>196—207.</cell></row></table>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="pVII-b7" facs="#f0011-b7"><lb n="17" facs="#f0011-l17"/>III. Die Volksbetriebsamkeit.</ab>
<table xml:id="pVII-b8" facs="#f0011-b8" rows="7" cols="2"><row><cell>1) Die Berufsklassen im Allgemeinen</cell><cell>208—213.</cell></row><row><cell>2) Landwirthschaft</cell><cell>213—231.</cell></row><row><cell>3) Viehzucht</cell><cell>231—236.</cell></row><row><cell>4) Forstwirthschaft</cell><cell>236—241.</cell></row><row><cell>5) Bergbau</cell><cell>242—252.</cell></row><row><cell>6) Industrie</cell><cell>252—258.</cell></row><row><cell>7) Handel und Verkehr</cell><cell>258—262.</cell></row></table>
<pb n="VIII" facs="#f0012" xml:id="pVIII"/>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="pVIII-b1" facs="#f0012-b1"><lb n="1" facs="#f0012-l1"/>IV. Der Staat.</ab>
<table xml:id="pVIII-b2" facs="#f0012-b2" rows="11" cols="2"><row><cell>1) Verfassung:</cell><cell>Seite.</cell></row><row><cell>a) Frühere Hauptverträge und Ordnungen</cell><cell>262—267.</cell></row><row><cell>b) Gegenwärtige Staatsverfassung</cell><cell>267—269.</cell></row><row><cell>c) Gemeindeverfassung</cell><cell>269—271.</cell></row><row><cell>2) Militair</cell><cell>271—272.</cell></row><row><cell>3) Staatsverwaltung</cell><cell>273—280.</cell></row><row><cell>4) Rechtspflege</cell><cell>280—289.</cell></row><row><cell>5) Kirche</cell><cell>289—296.</cell></row><row><cell>6) Schule</cell><cell>296—300.</cell></row><row><cell>7) Kunst- und wissenschaftliche Sammlungen</cell><cell>301—301.</cell></row><row><cell>8) Armenwesen</cell><cell>301—310.</cell></row></table>
<table xml:id="pVIII-b3" facs="#f0012-b3" rows="1" cols="2"><row><cell>V. Geschichte des Landes und seines Fürstenhauses</cell><cell>311—403.</cell></row></table>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="pVIII-b4" facs="#f0012-b4"><lb n="8" facs="#f0012-l8"/>II. Theil: Ortskunde des <placeName ref="#place-fuerstenthum-reuss-juengerer-linie">Fürstenthums Reuss j. L.</placeName></ab>
<table xml:id="pVIII-b5" facs="#f0012-b5" rows="3" cols="2"><row><cell>I. Der Landestheil oder <placeName ref="#place-landrathsamtsbezirk-gera">Landrathsamtsbezirk Gera</placeName></cell><cell>407—569.</cell></row><row><cell>II. Der Landestheil <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName> oder das <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-schleiz">Wisentaland</placeName></cell><cell>570—705.</cell></row><row><cell>III. Der Landestheil <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName></cell><cell>706—825.</cell></row></table>
